{%- comment -%}
  The batch a piece arrived with, as YYYY-MM-DD (owner, 2026-11-15: the catalogue sidebar's New arrivals
  lists every batch). It is the piece's tag batch-YYYY-MM-DD (pipeline/listings.py adds it), or, for a
  piece made in the admin without one, the day it was created. Move a piece to another batch by changing
  that tag. Usage: {% render 'batch', p: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign k = ''
  for t in p.tags
    if t contains 'batch-'
      assign k = t | remove_first: 'batch-' | strip
      break
    endif
  endfor
  if k == ''
    assign k = p.created_at | date: '%Y-%m-%d'
  endif
  echo k
-%}
